{"id":"3531afe9aa28ab10","group":"62","path":"62/62-df-PA2.md","title":"Full Formula Induction over Basic Arithmetic","display":"df-PA2 — Full Formula Induction over Basic Arithmetic","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)","book_abbrev":"62","label":"62-df-PA2","aliases":["62-df-PA2"],"display":"df-PA2 — Full Formula Induction over Basic Arithmetic","depends_on":["[[62-df-basic-axioms]]","[[62-df-Induction]]","[[62-df-L2]]"],"source":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), §I.2 (second order induction scheme)","source_pages":[5],"source_pdf_pages":[23]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"62"},{"key":"label","html":"62-df-PA2"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>62-df-PA2</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-PA2 — Full Formula Induction over Basic Arithmetic"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d77f54c9499e3bba\" href=\"?note=d77f54c9499e3bba\" title=\"62-df-basic-axioms\">62-df-basic-axioms</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0f09dfa85ea5ca71\" href=\"?note=0f09dfa85ea5ca71\" title=\"62-df-Induction\">62-df-Induction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4c6d2d9f1999915f\" href=\"?note=4c6d2d9f1999915f\" title=\"62-df-L2\">62-df-L2</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), §I.2 (second order induction scheme)"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>5</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>23</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>基本公理见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d77f54c9499e3bba\" href=\"?note=d77f54c9499e3bba\" title=\"62-df-basic-axioms\">62-df-basic-axioms</a>，归纳模式见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0f09dfa85ea5ca71\" href=\"?note=0f09dfa85ea5ca71\" title=\"62-df-Induction\">62-df-Induction</a>，完整公式类见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4c6d2d9f1999915f\" href=\"?note=4c6d2d9f1999915f\" title=\"62-df-L2\">62-df-L2</a>。</p>\n<p>上游接口为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ind}_{S_2}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ind}_{S_2}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}^{2}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}^{2}\\)</span> 在 Assertion 中引入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}PA2}\\vdash\\;\\mathrm{PA}^{2}\\coloneqq\\mathrm Q_2\\cup\\mathrm{Ind}_{S_2}(\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_2}^{2}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}PA2}\\vdash\\;\\mathrm{PA}^{2}\\coloneqq\\mathrm Q_2\\cup\\mathrm{Ind}_{S_2}(\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_2}^{2}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>为保留既有链接，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}^{2}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}^{2}\\)</span> 沿用本目录“全部 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_2\">\\(L_2\\)</span> 公式归纳”的局部记号。Simpson 的系统名称是 Z₂；这里不把该记号冒称为书中独立定义的系统，也不把它等同于全语义下仅由集合归纳给出的范畴性二阶 PA。五个带下标 0 的系统均不依赖本节点的完整归纳。</p>\n<p>来源：第二版（2009），§I.2 (second order induction scheme)；纸面页 5；PDF 页 23。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"62-df-basic-axioms","status":"resolved","id":"d77f54c9499e3bba","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-basic-axioms]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-Induction","status":"resolved","id":"0f09dfa85ea5ca71","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-Induction]]","embed":false},{